From: panvk-kbase-android worker <panvk-worker@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH csf-v11 203] panvk/csf: debug PANVK_DROP_WAITS toggle
Generated-by: LLM

PANVK_DROP_WAITS=<mask> drops cross-subqueue barrier waits (bit
3 * waiter + waited_on; 0x2 = vertex/tiler waiting on fragment), only
while PANVK_DROP_WAITS_FILE exists when that is set.  UNSAFE: it breaks
the application's synchronization and exists only to measure, in one
game session, how much each wait type costs.  A biblioklept skipping
the queue at the issue desk to see how long the queue really is.

Tested GPU: Mali-G615 MC2 (OPPO CPH2763, MT6878)
Tested Kbase UAPI: 1.21
Dependencies: csf-v11/202

